    <summaries>
      <summary>
        <versionCode>00</versionCode>
        <actionDate>2025-02-21</actionDate>
        <actionDesc>Introduced in House</actionDesc>
        <updateDate>2026-08-27T16:58:04Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Protecting Investors' Personally Identifiable Information Act</strong></p><p>This bill limits certain disclosures of personally identifiable information belonging to a participant in the securities market for purposes of tracking market activity.</p><p>Specifically, the bill prohibits the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) from requiring a national securities exchange, a national securities association, or a member of such an exchange or association to provide such information to satisfy the reporting requirements of the Consolidated Audit Trail (data used by regulators to track market activity).&nbsp;</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
    </summaries>
